1
00:00:08,104 --> 00:00:11,094
(Leonard:)Guys, our topic is
"Encouraging Women in Science."

2
00:00:11,274 --> 00:00:13,264
Can you at least play a less sexist game?

3
00:00:18,447 --> 00:00:19,817
(Sheldon:)How is it sexist?

4
00:00:20,483 --> 00:00:23,513
(Sheldon:)My character wields a battle ax
as well as any man.

5
00:00:24,987 --> 00:00:28,287
(Howard:)Not to mention she has mammary glands
that could nurse a family of 30.

6
00:00:29,926 --> 00:00:33,826
(Howard:)And have enough milk left over
to open a Baskin-Robbins.

7
00:00:35,698 --> 00:00:38,568
(Sheldon:)Mother, warrior-princess, franchise owner...

8
00:00:38,734 --> 00:00:41,674
(Sheldon:)...I hear glass ceilings shattering
all over town.

9
00:00:42,438 --> 00:00:45,898
(Leonard:)Sheldon, you're always saying
how much smarter you are than me.

10
00:00:46,075 --> 00:00:50,235
(Leonard:)Spend five seconds and come up with one
idea on how to get more women into science.

11
00:00:51,547 --> 00:00:55,847
(Sheldon:)All your ideas address the issue
at a university level. By then it's too late.

12
00:00:56,018 --> 00:00:59,718
You need to design a program that
targets girls at the middle-school level...

13
00:00:59,889 --> 00:01:04,019
(Sheldon:)...and sets them on an academic track
towards the hard sciences.

